      <description>Dépanneur Le Pick-Up - Montreal, Canada (Primary)
📍 7032 Rue Waverly, Montréal, QC H2S 3J2, Canada
📞 +1 514-271-8011
🔗 https://www.bonappetit.com/story/depanneur-le-pick-up
⭐ Signature Items:
• Grilled Halloumi Sandwich: The Bon Appétit-celebrated star: toasted seeded bread, fatty/tangy griddled golden halloumi, zingy mint-laced slaw, and harissa-honey mayo slathered on both sides — sweet, spicy, creamy, smoky
• Club Chipotle Sandwich: Triple-decker of chicken, bacon, lettuce, tomato, and chipotle mayo; classic and well executed
• Pulled Pork Sandwich: A house staple, also famously offered as a veggie pulled &quot;pork&quot; version</description>
